        {
          "type": "label",
          "param": "recentHistory",
          "label": "Recent History",
          "value": "Hired to redevelop an MS-Access app into a scalable solution, I built my first independent ASP.NET with ReactJS project.\n\nBefore long, a Junior developer was placed under my supervision, wherein I inherited their integrated Android app.\n\nMy employer went through a change of ownership. As the most IT-literate person in a mining-literate organisation, I was tasked with overseeing this transition, expanding my role into IT management.\n\nThis has been an intense but rewarding experience. The role took on many forms and responsibilities I was not expecting to receive. All things were taken in stride, and I delivered a high quality of service to the company while getting it done."
        },
